---
import { site, serviceLinks } from "../lib/site";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
---
<section class="transform-section section-space" aria-labelledby="transform-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <div><SectionHeading id="transform-title" lines={["Let’s talk about", "the smile you want."]} /></div>
      <p class="body-copy">Tell us what you’d like to change, whether it’s the look of your smile or how comfortably you bite and chew.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="treatment-features">
      <article class="treatment-feature" data-reveal>
        <div class="feature-top"><span class="small-label">Refine your smile</span><span class="feature-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div>
        <h3>Bring out what you<br />love about your smile.</h3>
        <p>Explore veneers and professional whitening with your own features, preferences, and goals in mind.</p>
        <a href={serviceLinks.veneers} class="text-link">Explore veneers <Icon /></a>
      </article>
      <article class="treatment-feature" data-reveal>
        <div class="feature-top"><span class="small-label">Restore your confidence</span><span class="feature-symbol feature-symbol-ring" aria-hidden="true">◎</span></div>
        <h3>Feel comfortable<br />chewing and smiling again.</h3>
        <p>Discover dental implants and restorative options for missing or damaged teeth, with a plan tailored to your needs.</p>
        <a href={serviceLinks.implants} class="text-link">Explore dental implants <Icon /></a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="consultation-note"><span>You don’t need to have it all figured out. That’s what a conversation is for.</span><a href={site.bookingUrl} class="text-link">Let’s talk <Icon /></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
